## Generated review renderings
#
# docs/review/*.html is a rendered convenience copy of the Markdown in docs/.
# Committing it would create a second source of truth that silently drifts from
# the Markdown it was generated from. The Markdown is authoritative.
docs/review/*.html

## Local secrets and device state — never commit
#
# No credential belongs in this repository. The SSH password is entered per
# session and never persisted (PRD 3.2).
*.env
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json
known_device_hosts
